Use this when the user asks for a YouTube video, episode, script, thumbnail or upload details.

- The full workflow is the skill at `.claude/skills/youtube-video-generator/SKILL.md`. Cursor loads it as a skill: type `/youtube-video-generator`.
- Cursor does not run Claude Code sub-agents. Do each step from the skill yourself, in order, and check each output before the next step.
- Run `python3 scripts/doctor.py` first. Do not continue while it shows a FAIL.
- Tool commands, file layout and rules are in `AGENTS.md`. Setup for every IDE is in `docs/IDE-SETUP.md`.
- Never print or commit API keys.
